# The applications in Palmframe's default install: works_minimal = yes (or
# partial, where what works is worth having) in apps.tsv. One binary name per
# line; each is distro/out/bin/<name> -> /usr/bin/<name>, with
# distro/apps/desktop/<name>.desktop -> /usr/share/applications/ where one
# exists (wm and greeter are the session, not launchable applications).
#
# Packaged but not installed by default (distro/recipes/generate.sh
# EXTRA_APPS and the runtime block): the demos (shop, pickdemo, home), ai
# (needs ollama), ocr (needs an API key and poppler), bluetooth (needs a
# kernel with Bluetooth), power and colorpick (partial), chat and forge (they
# need a chat or forge server; without one they say "not connected").
wm
greeter

